# Test and report artefacts. The context is what the build uploads and what the
# cache key of its layers is computed from, so an e2e run that rewrites
# playwright-report invalidated the layers of an image none of it belongs in.
# The image runs vite build and nothing else, so none of this is needed to
# compile the bundle. Keeping e2e out is why the Dockerfile calls build-only:
# the type check that "build" runs also reads tsconfig.e2e.json.
coverage
e2e
playwright-report
test-results
.env.preview
